  "implementation": [
    "Process three decoded quantized rows and four activation vectors with twelve F64 accumulator registers, three widened weight registers and one widened activation register",
    "Share each activation conversion across three rows; seven conversions serve twelve four-lane outputs, versus eight in the two-row/six-vector kernel",
    "Preserve exact widened-binary32 FMA, per-output four-lane order, 2048-element span boundaries, independent row refusal handling and physical weight ownership",
    "Use triples only for counts 4\u2013128 with remainder zero or one modulo four; use existing paired or single-row execution otherwise and for leftover rows",
    "Reuse existing decoding and matrix dispatch; fixed 24-KiB decoded scratch plus at most 3-KiB totals and 384-byte lane output, with no persistent allocation or new threads/runtime"
  ],
